            # SKILL DEVELOPMENT INFRASTRUCTURE
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="display-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text); margin: 0; font-weight: 800;">
