          Deploy your potential across typing velocity, advanced academic mathematics, multi-language coding, and real-time multiplayer arenas. Engineered for serious operators who need deterministic progress.
        </p>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding-top: 4px;">
          <button id="heroEnterArenaBtn" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="padding: 0 30px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; height: 48px;">
            Enter Arena <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size: 14px; margin-left: 6px;"></i>
          </button>
